===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|de|Apomixis}}, from {{der|en|grc|ᾰ̓πό||away (from)}} + {{m|grc|μίξις||[[mixing]], [[mingling]]}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|apomixes}}

# {{lb|en|botany}} Plant [[reproduction]] without [[fertilization]].
# {{lb|en|botany}} Plant [[reproduction]] without [[fertilization]], [[meiosis]], or the production of [[gamete]]s.
# {{lb|en|zoology}} Animal [[reproduction]] in which the egg cell does not undergo [[meiosis]] or [[fertilization]].

